    {
      "id": "37101271-9419-4be6-aed9-077a1cc6c002",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "49b3c685-deb3-4cff-aa35-4d2b4df2a9e4",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Clerk: Aurora did\nnot vanish. It was\nfiled under\nSeasonal Mood.\nThat",
                "drawer holds a tax\nappeal from a\nsnowman. Search\nthe catalog for",
                "SERVICE. The\npublic repair\nledger has a\nsquare seal;\nprivate sales",
                "use a crown."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d458b1a3-f19b-4de2-a8f9-9a5d0348d0ea",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "af1fab4c-4793-4cff-a932-5336893e0c2e",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The table holds\nthree index notes.\nDecember: repairs\ncomplete,",
                "signed by the\nengineer. January:\nsale proposed,\nunsigned.\nFebruary:",
                "ownership\nunchanged until a\ndeed is signed and\nentered. A\nresident",
                "named Mara needs\nto know who must\nfix her leaking\nstair pipe. She",
                "has already been\nsent between three\ndesks. The clerk\nsays a later",
                "date does not make\nan unsigned\nproposal into a\ncompleted\ntransfer."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e86e7673-7f5e-49eb-a2fc-406c40f9baf5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5a128ae8-1675-4b71-a833-4498aafbc625",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The catalog has\nthree seal marks.\nWhich mark\nidentifies the\npublic",
                "repair ledger? Use\nthe filing rule\nthe clerk gave\nyou, rather than",
                "the most\ndecorative cover."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "13827598-e3d9-4a38-a059-5f7e06c4afa0",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 3
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "672a06ec-678a-4493-aeaf-4c34c5aa49f2",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "The badge is warm\nfrom the clerk\nholding it. Its\nowner was the last",
                "city pipe walker.\nA penciled note\nreads: If anyone\nsays the network",
                "is dead, ask who\nstopped checking\nthe valves."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "6914e6c9-da7d-4d9a-a2cf-79863ad8ac76",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 4
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "4ddf19e0-e3e9-4342-a899-2bcffed1bdfd",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Mara asks whether\nthe newer sale\nproposal means she\nmust call a",
                "private estate\noffice. Consider\nthe dates,\nsignatures, and\nthe rule",
                "about entering a\ndeed. Which\nconclusion can the\nclerk support? Pip",
                "will put it on her\nreferral card and\nsign his name, so\na confident",
                "guess could send\nher back into the\ncold."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f068fec3-8d3d-4281-a954-f091c11ab8f5",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 5
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "fbaad62f-02fd-4596-a98f-ac7202b23ff6",
            "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
            "args": {
              "text": [
                "Foreman: I knew\nthat coat. Your\naunt carried soup\nin the left pocket",
                "and drawings in\nthe right.\nSometimes the\ndrawings smelled\nof leek.",
                "She left a\nmanifest here, and\na warning against\npeople selling",
                "perfect winters."
              ],
              "avatarId": "",
              "minHeight": 4,
              "maxHeight": 7,
              "position": "bottom",
              "closeWhen": "key",
              "closeButton": "a"
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    }
  ]
